title: Shiekh_Khaled_stage0
position: 81,-352
---
// --- DECLARATIONS ---
// Note: If you declared these in Stage 1 already, you don't need to declare them here again.
// Yarn only needs declarations once per project.
<<declare $Shiekh_Khaled_relationship = 0>>
<<declare $Shiekh_Khaled_progress = 0>>
<<declare $lightAdded = 0>>

// --- DIALOGUE START ---
<<if $Shiekh_Khaled_progress == 0>>
    
    // NARRATIVE: He is busy murmuring prayers, ignoring you.
    Old Khaled: ... *murmuring soft words* ...
    <<npc_gesture Shiekh_Khaled dismiss>>
    Old Khaled: ...The hearts turn like the turning of the day...

    // 1. MAKE SURE THESE ARROWS ARE ALIGNED VERTICALLY
    -> "As-salamu alaykum, Sheikh." 
        <<gesture nod>>
        <<jump stage0_Greeting_Good>>
    -> "Excuse me, sir?" 
        <<gesture wave>>
        <<jump stage0_Greeting_Neutral>>
    -> "Hey, wake up old man!" 
        <<gesture angry>>
        <<jump stage0_Greeting_Bad>>

<<elseif $Shiekh_Khaled_progress == 1>>
    // EXHAUSTED STATE
    Old Khaled: ...The fortress needs guarding...
    Old Khaled: ..TAB on it to see how well it is doing
    Old Khaled: ...I must rest my eyes now.
    <<npc_gesture Shiekh_Khaled dismiss>>
<<endif>>
===

// ---------------------------------------------------------
// PATH 1: THE GOOD GREETING (Respectful)
// ---------------------------------------------------------
title: stage0_Greeting_Good
position: 400,0
---
    // He looks up, pleased.
    <<npc_gesture Shiekh_Khaled nod>>
    Old Khaled: Wa alaykumu s-salam, young man.
    Old Khaled: It is rare to hear a gentle tongue in these times.
    <<set $Shiekh_Khaled_relationship += 10>>
    <<set $lightAdded = 10>>
    <<jump stage0_Core_Advice>>
===

// ---------------------------------------------------------
// PATH 2: THE NEUTRAL GREETING
// ---------------------------------------------------------
title: stage0_Greeting_Neutral
position: 80,150
---
    // He looks up, slowly.
    <<npc_gesture Shiekh_Khaled dismiss>>
    Old Khaled: ...Use the greeting of peace, my son. The world has enough noise already.
    <<set $Shiekh_Khaled_relationship += 0>>
    <<set $lightAdded = 0>>
    <<jump stage0_Core_Advice>>
===

// ---------------------------------------------------------
// PATH 3: THE BAD GREETING
// ---------------------------------------------------------
title: stage0_Greeting_Bad
position: -250,150
---
    // He frowns/denies.
    <<npc_gesture Shiekh_Khaled deny>>
    Old Khaled: ...Loud. You are very loud.
    Old Khaled: A loud voice shakes the dust, but it does not open the heart.
    <<set $Shiekh_Khaled_relationship -= 10>>
    <<set $lightAdded = -10>>
    <<jump stage0_Core_Advice>>
===

// ---------------------------------------------------------
// THE CORE ADVICE (Lore & Tutorial)
// ---------------------------------------------------------
title: stage0_Core_Advice
position: 80,400
---
Old Khaled: Tell me... you carry a heavy burden?
Old Khaled: I see the shadow in your chest.

// 2. CHECK INDENTATION HERE TOO
-> "Who are you?"
    <<gesture shrug>>
    <<npc_gesture Shiekh_Khaled wave>>
    // (Wave here acts as an inviting hand gesture)
    Old Khaled: I am Khaled. I water the thirsty hearts here, just as the farmer waters the corn.
    Old Khaled: But I cannot water a heart that is closed.
-> "What do you mean by shadow?"
    <<gesture lookAway>>
    <<npc_gesture Shiekh_Khaled dismiss>>
    Old Khaled: Every man has a place where the thief knocks. The shadow is the door you left unlocked.
-> "My chest feels heavy..."
    <<gesture nod>>
    <<npc_gesture Shiekh_Khaled nod>>
    Old Khaled: That is the weight of the Dunya (the world). Or perhaps... a leak in your fortress.

// THE MORAL LESSON (This plays after ANY choice above is finished)
Old Khaled: Listen to me well. Ibn al-Qayyim taught us: "The heart is a fortress."

<<npc_gesture Shiekh_Khaled cocky>>
// (Using 'cocky' for the NPC here works as a 'Preaching/Confidence' gesture)
Old Khaled: If you leave the gate open, the Enemy enters and claims the throne.

Old Khaled: Guard your light, young man. Do not let it fade.

<<set $Shiekh_Khaled_progress = 1>>
<<jump Shiekh_Khaled_exhausted>>
===

title: Shiekh_Khaled_exhausted
position: 80,650
---
// Ending the conversation
Old Khaled: ...Now, I must return to my beads.
<<npc_gesture Shiekh_Khaled dismiss>>
===